(https://github.com/Shadowlauch/eve-incursions-node): the maximum remaining time per incursion
state and the 12/36-hour spawn windows. Its recorded constellation layouts (vanguard, assault and
headquarters systems, from the project's seed data) are included as
crates/incursions/data/layouts.json. Distributed under the following licence:

